# CI matrix leg: the audio engine compiled in, with the AMY seam on its
# built-in voice. Link Audio itself stays off here — it needs the Link-4.0
# submodule, and this leg exists to prove the audio path builds against a
# no-op ILinkAudio just as well as against the real one.
# Combined with sdkconfig.defaults and sdkconfig.defaults.amyboard.
CONFIG_NEON_AUDIO=y
CONFIG_NEON_AUDIO_INPUT=y
# CONFIG_NEON_AUDIO_AMY is not set
